flowchart TD
    Start([Mulai]) --> Login[Login via Email + OTP]
    Login --> CekOTP{OTP Valid?}
    CekOTP -- Tidak --> Login
    CekOTP -- Ya --> Consent{Setuju Privacy Policy?}
    Consent -- Tidak --> Logout([Logout])
    Consent -- Ya --> Dashboard[Dashboard Eksternal]
    Dashboard --> PilihAksi{Pilih Aksi}
    
    PilihAksi -- Buat Request --> FormRequest[Isi Form Request Site Visit]
    PilihAksi -- Lihat Status --> DetailVisit[Lihat Detail Visit]
    PilihAksi -- Feedback --> Feedback[Isi Feedback Post-Visit]
    
    FormRequest --> Validasi{Validasi Form}
    Validasi -- Gagal --> FormRequest
    Validasi -- Sukses --> CekQuota{Cek Quota & Blacklist}
    CekQuota -- Gagal --> Error[Pesan Error]
    Error --> FormRequest
    CekQuota -- Sukses --> Submit[Submit Request]
    Submit --> StatusRequested[Status: requested]
    StatusRequested --> NotifAdmin[Notifikasi ke THC Admin]
    NotifAdmin --> TungguApproval[Tunggu Approval]
    
    TungguApproval --> CekApproval{Approval?}
    CekApproval -- Approved --> StatusApproved[Status: approved]
    CekApproval -- Rejected --> StatusRejected[Status: rejected]
    CekApproval -- Timeout 7 hari --> AutoCancel[Status: cancelled]
    
    StatusApproved --> NotifPIC[Notifikasi ke PIC & Visitor]
    NotifPIC --> ReminderH1[Reminder H-1]
    ReminderH1 --> HariH[Datang ke Lokasi]
    HariH --> CheckIn[Check-in di Security]
    CheckIn --> StatusVisiting[Status: visiting]
    StatusVisiting --> SelesaiVisit[Selesai Kunjungan]
    SelesaiVisit --> CheckOut[Check-out]
    CheckOut --> StatusCompleted[Status: completed]
    StatusCompleted --> Feedback
    Feedback --> Selesai([Selesai])
    
    StatusRejected --> Selesai
    AutoCancel --> Selesai
    DetailVisit --> Selesai